},{"identifier":"C","content":"64%"},{"identifier":"D","content":"25%"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"<p>The weight of an object at a distance d from the center of the Earth is given by:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.797ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.782ex\" height=\"3.229ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1074.9 6091.5 1427\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1136.2,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1658.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2714.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3762.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(458,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(303.4,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><rect width=\"736.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1434.7,0) translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-29\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1925.7,604) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>W' is the weight at distance d,</li>\n<li>W is the weight at the Earth's surface,</li>\n<li>R is the radius of the Earth,</li>\n<li>d is the distance from the center of the Earth.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>In this problem, we are asked to find the percentage decrease in weight, which can be calculated by:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.442ex\" height=\"2.93ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -934.7 9477.4 1295.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2158.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3214.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,398) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1048,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1826,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1136.2,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(983.2,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D44A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44A\"></use></g><rect width=\"2467.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6144.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:hr